msgstr "**테스트한 기기**: iPhone 12, iOS 18.4, Android 11"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/mobile/secure-mobile-file-storage.rst:174
msgid ""
"**Apps Used**: Adobe Reader, Google Files app, Android’s native Files "
"app, iOS Files app, Files Media Manager, Hidden Files Finder, Hidden "
"Files Finder & Recover"
msgstr ""
"**사용한 앱**: Adobe Reader, Google Files 앱, Android의 네이티브 Files 앱, iOS "
"Files 앱, Files Media Manager, Hidden Files Finder, Hidden Files Finder & "
